   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/essentials-of-shanghai/lh_app_shanghai_illustration_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Menschen, die sich auf Shanghainesisch unterhalten"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Essentials of Shanghai",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>9. October 2025 | 2 min read | Lufthansa Editorial Team</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>A metropolis of superlatives – the world's largest subway network takes you to the fastest elevator in the world: here are five things about Shanghai that will surprise you.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Rapid Ascent</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "The fastest elevator in the world is located in the Shanghai Tower: it travels at 65 km/h to reach the 118th floor in 55 seconds.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Mega Subway Network</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "With more than 500 stations, a route length of 802 kilometers, and over 3.5 billion passengers a year, Shanghai has the largest subway network in the world.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/essentials-of-shanghai/lh_app_shanghai_illustration1_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Links: eine Rakete in Form eines Gebäudes, die gerade startet. Rechts: ein Globus, der ein U-Bahn-Netz abbildet"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
