  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Shanghai's Native Tongue</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Excuse me? Shanghai has its own language that hardly anyone else in China understands? That's right, more than 13 million people speak Shanghainese, a mishmash of Chinese dialects, English, French, and other languages. However, Shanghainese is only spoken, the written and official language is Mandarin.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/essentials-of-shanghai/lh_app_shanghai_illustration2_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Links: Menschen, die sich auf Shanghainesisch unterhalten. Rechts: übergroßer Mensch baut Art-déco-Gebäude"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>The Capital of Art Deco</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "No other city in the world has as many art deco buildings as Shanghai. Famous buildings include the Metropole Hotel and the former Bank of China.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/essentials-of-shanghai/lh_app_shanghai_illustration3_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Illustration einer Frau, die eine weiße Magnolie überreicht bekommt"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Blossoming Landmark</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "So pure, elegant, and beautiful: the white Yulan magnolia has been the official city flower since 1986. It blooms and fills the air with its fragrance in many of Shanghai's parks and green spaces in spring.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "all illustrations © Sylvia Neuner",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
